  task=f'impl-{n:03}';pkg=package(n);b=pkg['differences'];r=json.loads((REC/f'014_reruns_{task}.json').read_text());queries=json.loads((REC/f'014_queries_{task}.json').read_text());count=sum(q['kind']=='核实查询' for q in queries)
  slim=next((REC/'013_packages').glob(f'013_{task}_*.md'));contract=pkg['contract_specification'];block=contract['blocks'][0]
  lines=[f"# {task} / {b['table']}",'','## 1. 错在哪里','',a['desc'],'',a['reason'],'','## 2. 依据','',f"- 起点：[013精简包](../013_packages/{slim.name})。原013状态不改。",f"- 契约：`{contract['source_path']}`，第{block['start_line']}–{block['end_line']}行。",f"- agent SQL：`{pkg['agent_final_SQL'][0]['path']}`；gold SQL：`{pkg['gold_SQL_仅供定位差异'][0]['path']}`。精简包完整收录；下列补丁逐字给出定位原文。",f"- [完整事件记录](../014_trace_{task}.json)；事件文件在该JSON的path中，可回查traces/dacomp_deimpl_prev.tar.gz。",f"- [查询原文与结果](../014_queries_{task}.json)、[全部重跑记录](../014_reruns_{task}.json)。",'','## 3. agent看过什么','',a['seen'],'','已逐题核对event 1 message，包含本表契约完整原文；这不是把磁盘上存在的文档等同于agent已经阅读。schema输出、源数据值、运行日志分别处理。轨迹全量转录未删去截断标记；被截断的未显示部分不作为看到的证据。','','## 4. 查询与重跑','',f"核实查询实际执行 **{count}条**；核实代价：**{a['cost']}**。诊断查询不计入5条限制。重复执行的查询仍计数。",'']
  terms={1:['created_at','archived_at','_row_num'],2:['url','latitude','md5','MD5','CONCAT','concat'],3:['row_number','priority','rank'],4:['history_unique_key','last_activity_date','current_timestamp','hash'],5:['campaign_id','campaign_base_campaign','conversions','DECIMAL','spend'],6:['NULL::','ctr','cpc','ecpm','spend','video_started','comment_upvotes','comment_downvotes','viewer_comments'],7:['subscriber_id','promotional_offer_id','marketing_opt_in_duration','subscription_offer_duration','source_relation'],8:['project_id','string_agg','STRING_AGG','projects_sections'],9:['country','JOIN'],10:['guid','created_timestamp','updated_timestamp','row_number','rn =','_fivetran_synced']}[n]
  evidence=['### SQL行号定位','']
